## Meal & snack distribution

Page 4 (`servingsGridRows` in `js/servingsPrintout.js`) and the menu plan (`menuPlanServingCount` in `js/stapleServingPrintout.js`) use **`stapleCategoryServings`** — daily total ÷ 3 for protein, grains, and fruit (decimals when needed; same count in every breakfast/lunch/dinner or fruit-snack column). Vegetables use the full daily count (all at dinner).

| Group | Per meal/snack column |
|-------|------------------------|
| Protein (+ dairy) | `daily protein ÷ 3` |
| Grains & starches | `daily grainsStarches ÷ 3` |
| Vegetables | full daily count (dinner on menu plan) |
| Fruits | `daily fruits ÷ 3` per snack |
| Extra fat | **Not** in servings grid — total `fatMaintain` only |

