## PDF & printout system

| Layer | What it shows | Example (chicken, 3 lunch protein servings) |
|-------|---------------|-----------------------------------------------|
| **Servings page** | Counts only | `3` — no grams |
| **Program report food list** | Plan slot servings × base gram weight | `78g` (3 × 26g) |

### Burn & Build Diet PDF

Renderer: `server/pdf/renderSampleDietPrintout.js`. Preview: `.cursor/rules/sample-diet-pdf.mdc`.

| Page | Grams? |
|------|--------|
| Servings | **Counts only** |
| Food list (protein, grains, veg, fruit) | **Scaled grams** |

### Food-list scaling (`js/stapleServingPrintout.js`)

```
displayed grams = stapleCategoryServings(planServings, category) × base one-serving weight
```

| Food-list section | Multiplier |
|-------------------|------------|
| Protein + dairy | `planServings.protein / 3` |
| Grains & starches | `planServings.grainsStarches / 3` |
| Vegetables | `planServings.vegetables` (daily) |
| Fruit | `planServings.fruits / 3` |
| Extra fat / sugar / alcohol | Not on staple pages |

Payload: `payload.servings.planServings` from `js/sampleDietPrintoutData.js`.

Purchased **Burn & Build Diet** PDF uses `GET /api/programs/diet-pdf`. Landing sample uses `GET /api/samples/sample-diet` (live program on Render).

